-lock="2026-10-27T02:54:00Z" data-glance-expires="2026-10-23T19:43:39.234092Z" data-glance-priced="1" data-glance-research="0"><div class="glance-card-top"><span class="glance-card-teams">FlyQuest<span class="vs">vs</span>Staqued</span><span class="glance-card-time">27 Oct · 03:00 UTC</span></div><div class="glance-card-pick "><span class="glance-card-pick-label">OUR PICK</span><div class="glance-card-scores"><div class="glance-card-score"><span class="glance-card-pick-team">FlyQuest</span><span class="glance-card-prob">92.3%</span></div><div class="glance-card-score other"><span class="glance-card-other-team">Staqued</span><span class="glance-card-other-prob">7.7%</span></div></div><div class="glance-card-prob-bar"><i style="width:92.3%"></i></div></div><div class="glance-card-meta">Listing-derived estimate · DFRAG Invitational 2026</div></a></li><li><a class="glance-card-mobile" href="evidence.html#match-1082861" data-glance-start="2026-10-27T03:00:00Z" data-glance-lock="2026-10-27T02:54:00Z" data-glance-expires="2026-10-23T19:43:39.234092Z" data-glance-priced="1" data-glance-research="0"><div class="glance-card-top"><span class="glance-card-teams">Rooster<span class="vs">vs</span>Abyssal</span><span class="glance-card-time">27 Oct · 03:00 UTC</span></div><div class="glance-card-pick "><span class="glance-card-pick-label">OUR PICK</span><div class="glance-card-scores"><div class="glance-card-score other"><span class="glance-card-other-team">Rooster</span><span class="glance-card-other-prob">48.2%</span></div><div class="glance-card-score"><span class="glance-card-pick-team">Abyssal</span><span class="glance-card-prob">51.8%</span></div></div><div class="glance-card-prob-bar"><i style="width:51.8%"></i></div></div><div class="glance-card-meta">Our VRS model line · DFRAG Invitational 2026</div></a></li><li><a class="glance-card-mobile" href="evidence.html#match-1082897" data-glance-start="2026-10-27T08:00:00Z" data-glance-lock="2026-10-27T07:54:00Z" data-glance-expires="2026-10-23T19:42:05.459228Z" data-glance-priced="1" data-glance-research="0"><div class="glance-card-top"><span class="glance-card-teams">B8<span class="vs">vs</span>K27</span><span class="glance-card-time">27 Oct · 08:00 UTC</span></div><div class="glance-card-pick "><span class="glance-card-pick-label">OUR PICK</span><div class="glance-card-scores"><div class="glance-card-score"><span class="glance-card-pick-team">B8</span><span class="glance-card-prob">62.0%</span></div><div class="glance-card-score other"><span class="glance-card-other-team">K27</span><span class="glance-card-other-prob">38.0%</span></div></div><div class="glance-card-prob-bar"><i style="width:62.0%"></i></div></div><div class="glance-card-meta">Market line · Tesla Cup 2026</div></a></li><li><a class="glance-card-mobile" href="evidence.html#match-1082898" data-glance-start="2026-10-27T11:00:00Z" data-glance-lock="2026-10-27T10:54:00Z" data-glance-expires="2026-10-23T19:32:05.560001Z" data-glance-priced="1" data-glance-research="0"><div class="glance-card-top"><span class="glance-card-teams">Alliance<span class="vs">vs</span>FaZe</span><span class="glance-card-time">27 Oct · 11:00 UTC</span></div><div class="glance-card-pick "><span class="glance-card-pick-label">OUR PICK</span><div class="glance-card-scores"><div class="glance-card-score other"><span class="glance-card-other-team">Alliance</span><span class="glance-card-other-prob">34.0%</span></div><div class="glance-card-score"><span class="glance-card-pick-team">FaZe</span><span class="glance-card-prob">66.0%</span></div></div><div class="glance-card-prob-bar"><i style="width:66.0%"></i></div></div><div class="glance-card-meta">Market line · Tesla Cup 2026</div></a></li><li><a class="glance-card-mobile" href="evidence.html#match-1082900" data-glance-start="2026-10-27T17:00:00Z" data-glance-lock="2026-10-27T16:54:00Z" data-glance-expires="2026-10-23T19:42:05.459228Z" data-glance-priced="1" data-glance-research="0"><div class="glance-card-top"><span class="glance-card-teams">Luminosity<span class="vs">vs</span>HOTU</span><span class="glance-card-time">27 Oct · 17:00 UTC</span></div><div class="glance-card-pick "><span class="glance-card-pick-label">OUR PICK</span><div class="glance-card-scores"><div class="glance-card-score"><span class="glance-card-pick-team">Luminosity</span><span class="glance-card-prob">55.0%</span></div><div class="glance-card-score other"><span class="glance-card-other-team">HOTU</span><span class="glance-card-other-prob">45.0%</span></div></div><div class="glance-card-prob-bar"><i style="width:55.0%"></i></div></div><div class="glance-card-meta">Market line · Tesla Cup 2026</div></a></li><li><a class="glance-card-mobile" href="evidence.html#match-1082901" data-glance-start="2026-10-27T20:00:00Z" data-glance-lock="2026-10-27T19:54:00Z" data-glance-expires="2026-10-23T19:32:05.560001Z" data-glance-priced="1" data-glance-research="0"><div class="glance-card-top"><span class="glance-card-teams">Envy<span class="vs">vs</span>GamerLegion</span><span class="glance-card-time">27 Oct · 20:00 UTC</span></div><div class="glance-card-pick "><span class="glance-card-pick-label">OUR PICK</span><div class="glance-card-scores"><div class="glance-card-score other"><span class="glance-card-other-team">Envy</span><span class="glance-card-other-prob">46.5%</span></div><div class="glance-card-score"><span class="glance-card-pick-team">GamerLegion</span><span class="glance-card-prob">53.5%</span></div></div><div class="glance-card-prob-bar"><i style="width:53.5%"></i></div></div><div class="glance-card-meta">Market line · Tesla Cup 2026</div></a></li><li><a class="glance-card-mobile" href="evidence.html#match-1082792" data-glance-start="2026-10-31T09:00:00Z" data-glance-lock="2026-10-31T08:54:00Z" data-glance-expires="2026-10-23T19:43:39.234092Z" data-glance-priced="1" data-glance-research="0"><div class="glance-card-top"><span class="glance-card-teams">HOTU<span class="vs">vs</span>The Huns</span><span class="glance-card-time">31 Oct · 09:00 UTC</span></div><div class="glance-card-pick "><span class="glance-card-pick-label">OUR PICK</span><div class="glance-card-scores"><div class="glance-card-score"><span class="glance-card-pick-team">HOTU</span><span class="glance-card-prob">85.2%</span></div><div class="glance-card-score other"><span class="glance-card-other-team">The Huns</span><span class="glance-card-other-prob">14.8%</span></div></div><div class="glance-card-prob-bar"><i style="width:85.2%"></i></div></div><div class="glance-card-meta">Our VRS model line · Moscow Cyber Games 2026</div></a></li><li><a class="glance-card-mobile" href="evidence.html#match-1082793" data-glance-start="2026-10-31T13:00:00Z" data-glance-lock="2026-10-31T12:54:00Z" data-glance-expires="2026-10-23T19:43:39.234092Z" data-glance-priced="1" data-glance-research="0"><div class="glance-card-top"><span class="glance-card-teams">5star<span class="vs">vs</span>1WIN</span><span class="glance-card-time">31 Oct · 13:00 UTC</span></div><div class="glance-card-pick "><span class="glance-card-pick-label">OUR PICK</span><div class="glance-card-scores"><div class="glance-card-score other"><span class="glance-card-other-team">5star</span><span class="glance-card-other-prob">24.3%</span></div><div class="glance-card-score"><span class="glance-card-pick-team">1WIN</span><span class="glance-card-prob">75.7%</span></div></div><div class="glance-card-prob-bar"><i style="width:75.7%"></i></div></div><div class="glance-card-meta">Our VRS model line · Moscow Cyber Games 2026</div></a></li></ol><p class="small glance-foot">Snapshot 23 Oct 2026 · 11:47 UTC. The board re-checks Hotspawn every 15 minutes (plus a stale-watchdog). <a class="" href="picks.html">Full updated pick board →</a> · <a class="" href="unresolved.html">Unresolved &amp; limitations →</a> · <a class="" href="matches.html">All matches →</a></p></section><section class="panel" id="unresolved-limits" aria-label="Unresolved picks and the limitations for generating them"><p class="eyebrow muted">Executive summary &middot; unresolved picks &amp; limitations</p><h2>Unresolved picks, and why a pick can be missing</h2><p>At this snapshot <strong>every one of the 27 open matches</strong> carries a pick and a win probability, so this section has nothing to list. Nothing here is ever filled in with a default 50/50, and the limitations below are what would apply to any row a later refresh cannot price.</p><ul class="checklist"><li><strong>A source that refuses or omits a price is a collection limit, not a finding.</strong> Access controls are never bypassed, a missing automated adapter is not evidence that a book has no line, and a blocked or unreadable page is recorded as such rather than converted into a number.</li><li><strong>Our own line needs both teams.</strong> The <a class="" href="sources.html#model">VRS model</a> prices a match only when both clubs resolve in Valve&rsquo;s official standings with a current roster; with one side missing the row drops to a research-only pick and no percentage is shown.</li><li><strong>Names and times must match exactly.</strong> A price moves between sites only for an exact team pair and UTC start, or through the <a class="" href="sources.html#method">verified alias register</a>. Where two sources disagree about the fixture itself the price is withheld and <a class="" href="review.html">flagged for review</a>.</li><li><strong>Evidence expires.</strong> Every percentage dies at the earliest of its eight-hour evidence window, the Hotspawn lock, the match start or the bookmaker cutoff, so a pick can vanish before a match starts if a refresh does not land.</li></ul><p class="glance-actions"><a class="button secondary" href="#unresolved-summary">Full unresolved section ↓</a><a class="button secondary" href="unresolved.html">Open the unresolved page →</a><a class="button secondary" href="review.html">Flagged for review →</a></p></section><section class="panel" id="unresolved-picks" aria-label="Unresolved picks and their limitations"><p class="eyebrow muted">Executive summary · unresolved picks &amp; limitations</p><h2>Picks without a win probability — and exactly why</h2><p><span data-count="missing">0</span> of the <span data-count="open">27</span> open matches publish no win percentage; <span data-count="unresolved">0</span> of those have no supported pick. Blank means unverified, never 50/50. Each row below states the source that was tried and the gate it failed.</p><p class="notice info"><strong>Nothing is blank.</strong> Every open match at this snapshot has a pick and a win probability.</p><details class="method-details"><summary>Evidence ladder &amp; source rules</summary><h3>What is tried, in order, before a blank is published</h3><p class="small">This is the publication ladder from <a class="" href="sources.html#method">the method page</a>. Hotspawn supplies the fixture list only; its crowd percentages are never used as a probability.</p><ol class="checklist ladder"><li><strong>1. Polymarket exchange line, strict gate</strong><p class="muted">Two-sided, funded and fresh: spread 25 points or less, at least $100 of liquidity, and an observation no older than eight hours. De-vigged from both outcome prices.</p><p class="small">Source: <a class="" href="https://gamma-api.polymarket.com/events">Polymarket Gamma API ↗</a></p></li><li><strong>2. HLTV fixture identity, rankings and lineups</strong><p class="muted">Confirms the exact opponent pair and UTC start, the world ranking and the current five. HLTV’s own betting table exposes no numeric two-way price to this collector, and its community vote is never used as a probability.</p><p class="small">Source: <a class="" href="https://www.hltv.org/matches">HLTV match pages ↗</a></p></li><li><strong>3. Pinnacle esports moneyline</strong><p class="muted">A sharp bookmaker’s two-way price for the exact fixture, de-vigged with the same formula. One bookmaker is not a consensus.</p><p class="small">Source: <a class="" href="https://guest.api.arcadia.pinnacle.com/0.1/sports/12/markets/straight">Pinnacle guest esports API ↗</a></p></li><li><strong>4. Wide exchange quote, labelled low confidence</strong><p class="muted">Used only when a row would otherwise have no pick at all: still two-sided, funding and freshness gates unchanged, spread between 25 and 60 points. The real spread is published.</p><p class="small">Source: <a class="" href="https://gamma-api.polymarket.com/events">Polymarket Gamma API ↗</a></p></li><li><strong>5. Researched bookmaker listing</strong><p class="muted">A dated two-way price read from a listing page, accepted only when it re-confirms the exact pair, the exact UTC start and an asymmetric pair bound to both team labels. The identical 1.8 / 1.8 placeholder some listings serve is refused, never published.</p><p class="small">Source: <a class="" href="https://egamersworld.com/counterstrike/matches">EGamersWorld CS2 listing ↗</a></p></li><li><strong>6. Our own VRS model line</strong><p class="muted">Valve’s official Regional Standings points through Valve’s own published expected-win formula and calibration. Labelled as our model everywhere; never presented as a market price.</p><p class="small">Source: <a class="" href="https://github.com/ValveSoftware/counter-strike_regional_standings">Valve counter-strike_regional_standings ↗</a></p></li><li><strong>7. Our VRS model from HLTV’s dated Valve ranking</strong><p class="muted">Only when Valve’s monthly file cannot resolve the clubs: the same formula and calibration, with points from HLTV’s dated Valve-points list, explicit provenance and the same expiry gates. Not an operator price or a claim that HLTV’s current points occur in the older monthly file.</p><p class="small">Source: <a class="" href="https://www.hltv.org/valve-ranking/teams">HLTV dated Valve ranking ↗</a></p></li><li><strong>8. Research pick, no percentage</strong><p class="muted">Ranking-order evidence for an exact fixture, one side listed in Valve’s official standings while the other side is absent from that file, or — weakest and last — HLTV’s own recent completed results for both teams on the fixture page (more wins over the same number of recent matches; HLTV’s lifetime head-to-head series wins break a tie; still level stays unresolved). A directional pick only — the percentage and the fair odds stay blank.</p><p class="small">Source: <a class="" href="https://www.hltv.org/ranking/teams">HLTV rankings and Valve standings ↗</a></p></li></ol></details><p class="small"><a class="" href="unresolved.html">Full unresolved &amp; non-market queue →</a> · <a class="" href="unresolved.html#coverage-boundary">Matches that can never carry a pick →</a> · <a class="" href="sources.html">Source health and access results →</a> · <a class="" href="review.html">Flagged for review →</a></p></section><details class="briefing-more" id="detailed-summary"><summary>Detailed tables, source attempts &amp; coverage notes</summary><nav class="section-nav" aria-label="Where the picks are"><a href="picks.html">Updated picks (<span data-count="open">27</span>)</a><a href="unresolved.html?status=needs">No percentage (<span data-count="missing">0</span>)</a><a class="" href="matches.html">Every match (90)</a><a class="" href="analysis.html">TWC day 1–5 analysis</a><a class="" href="analysis.html#day-four-results">Day-4 results</a><a class="" href="analysis.html#day-three-results">Day-3 results (record)</a></nav><div class="notice info" id="coverage-line"><strong>Coverage at 23 Oct · 11:47 UTC:</strong> <span data-count="open">27</span> open fixture(s) — <span data-count="priced">27</span> with published probabilities (<span data-count="market">23</span> from markets, <span data-count="model">4</span> from our VRS model), <span data-count="researched">0</span> with a labelled research-only pick and no percentage, <span data-count="unresolved">0</span> with no supported pick yet. <a class="" href="picks.html">Open the pick board →</a> · <a class="" href="#unresolved-summary">Jump to the unresolved section ↓</a></div><section class="stats" aria-label="Coverage at last check" id="coverage"><a class="stat" href="matches.html?status=open"><div class="stat-label">Open matches <span>↗</span></div><strong data-count="open">27</strong><span class="stat-foot">90 total feed entries</span></a><a class="stat green" href="picks.html"><div class="stat-label">With probabilities <span>↗</span></div><strong data-count="priced">27</strong><span class="stat-foot"><span data-count="percent">100</span>% of open · 23 market · 4 model</span></a><a class="stat amber" href="unresolved.html"><div class="stat-label">No market line <span>↗</span></div><strong>04</strong><span class="stat-foot">4 model line(s) · 0 research pick(s) · 0 unresolved</span></a></section><section class="panel" id="phone-tips" aria-label="Refresh schedule and how to read a row"><p class="eyebrow muted">Refresh &amp; how to read a row</p><h2>Updated picks, on a schedule.</h2><p>The collector checks Hotspawn on a <strong>15-minute schedule</strong>, with a <strong>10-minute watchdog</strong> that requests a refresh when the published snapshot is over <strong>90 minutes old</strong>. GitHub may delay a run, so every row publishes its observation and expiry time. <strong data-count="missing">0</strong> currently open match(es) have no verified win percentage: choose <em>No percentage</em> on <a class="" href="unresolved.html?status=needs">Unresolved</a> to see the reason for each. Unsupported numbers stay blank.</p></section><div class="notice info"><strong>Our own lines fill the market gaps.</strong> <span data-count="model">4</span> open match(es) have no usable betting line, so the probability is <strong>our originated line</strong>: Valve’s official Regional Standings points run through Valve’s own published win-expectation formula and calibration. It is labelled on every row and never presented as a market price. <a class=